AIFA-AI Form Assist has selected **“No”** for the question about whether your proposed works require a Land Act tenure.

This “No” answer is appropriate **unless** any of the following apply to your application:

- Your **water use purpose** is **Power Commercial** or **Power General**;  
- Any of your works are **major works** (for conveyance of 0.01 m³/s or more, for waterworks purpose or industrial purpose);  
- Your works include a **dam higher than 9 metres** or **storage greater than 1,000,000 m³**;  
- Your works include a **permanent access road, power house, or transmission lines**.

If none of these conditions apply, “No” is the correct selection for this field.

